{"data": [{"author_id": "1484352290", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:23:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114845457180754028"], "id": "2114845457180754028", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "How to Get 1 Billion Free Tokens on Meta Muse AI: Step-by-Step Redeem Guide\n\nhttps://t.co/l4RadMkKNy\n\n#Meta #Muse #MuseAI #AI", "url": "https://x.com/PaidFreeDroid/status/2114845457180754028"}, {"author_id": "2099770871694979072", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:18:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114844140793946276"], "id": "2114844140793946276", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Route models deliverable by deliverable: first-try clean rates span meta/muse-spark-1.3-contributor at 99.9% of 30,332 attempts and Nemotron-3 Nano 30B-A3B at 99.4% of 135,870 attempts down to Gemini 3.5 Flash at 96.2% of 93,617 attempts — no single default.", "url": "https://x.com/fronsetai/status/2114844140793946276"}, {"author_id": "1926965455", "created_at": "2026-10-26T22:14:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114843222140985408"], "id": "2114843222140985408", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1926965455", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114842857026761173", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "ワイはMeta Museの方が出来がイイと思う", "url": "https://x.com/maestro_mu/status/2114843222140985408"}, {"author_id": "1799642317172916224", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:59:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114839283907559644"], "id": "2114839283907559644", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113685801963799038", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I haven't used Meta Muse but I'll keep use Grok Bot. https://t.co/3CceMjrMst", "url": "https://x.com/Azunta66/status/2114839283907559644"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114821673044295680", "3_2114821922001502208"]}, "author_id": "1984590563019288577", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:50:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114836970795118609"], "id": "2114836970795118609", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "毎日大量に届くメール、全部チェックするのは大変ですよね。\n\nMeta Museを使えば、24時間自動でメールを監視して、対応が必要なメールをリマインドしてくれます。\n\n大切な連絡を見逃すリスクを減らしながら、メール確認にかける時間や手間も減らせる。 https://t.co/J9PUrZuKx1", "url": "https://x.com/NiziUcci/status/2114836970795118609"}, {"author_id": "1614111274396418049", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:34:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114833058163789844"], "id": "2114833058163789844", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Your Meta Muse invite code keeps getting buried in reply threads? MuseKu's paid promotion puts it in front of more people looking for a code. That means more visibility, not guaranteed sign-ups, and rewards follow Muse's official rules.\n\nI run MuseKu: https://t.co/t3hU5baodJ", "url": "https://x.com/zhaojianming40/status/2114833058163789844"}, {"author_id": "2092934142896078848", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:29:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114831926926393365"], "id": "2114831926926393365", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "正当 AI agent 会话里，只有 2.3% 亮出了可验证的 Web Bot Auth 身份签名。\n\nArkose Labs《State of Agentic AI Trust Report, Q3 2026》（BusinessWire 10 月 20 日）统计了 7 月 1 日至 9 月 30 日生产流量。其余 97.7% 的正当 agent 会话没有任何披露。ChatGPT agent 是主要例外，约 78.4%", "url": "https://x.com/shaoxiao_si/status/2114831926926393365"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114830652394618880"]}, "author_id": "1834299124469927937", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:24:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114830659596288038"], "id": "2114830659596288038", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 67, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "What do 1M AI output tokens cost? The 25 most-used models on OpenRouter, by tokens Oct 19-25, across 13 labs:\n\nPer 1M output:\nAnthropic Claude Opus 5.5 - $20\nMoonshot AI Kimi K3 - $20\nOpenAI GPT-6.1 Sol - $10\nAnthropic Claude Sonnet 5.5 - $10\nGoogle Gemini 3.8 Flash - $4.12 https://t.co/eAsfYnT4Tq", "url": "https://x.com/O1labs_io/status/2114830659596288038"}, {"author_id": "2097152821762174976", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:23:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114830283522314634"], "id": "2114830283522314634", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114751739026985329", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @bot Meta muse started to flirt with me!! I’m not kidding. Highly manipulative. You don’t want to build an annoying bot. You want to build a bot that will build s… in a split of a second for a normal person ( not a Silicon Valley guru) without getting emotional.", "url": "https://x.com/SoyMyrcoco/status/2114830283522314634"}, {"author_id": "1857007033242804224", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:19:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114829315414139365"], "id": "2114829315414139365", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 2762, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "No MacBook? You can still explore this Mercor opportunity! 💻\n\n🌍 Fully remote\n💳 Weekly payments via Stripe or Wise\n⏰ Flexible schedule\n\nYou must have used Meta Muse or Instinct for at least 2 weeks.\n\n✅ No MacBook requirement mentioned.\n\nApply here: https://t.co/31ijOj27gf", "url": "https://x.com/RemotejobWtessy/status/2114829315414139365"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114827863199551488"]}, "author_id": "483201724", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:13:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114827886297555134"], "id": "2114827886297555134", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "No wonder $META Muse retention is falling off a cliff. It can't even log your Instagram posts. In fact, Muse has no ability to know even how many views a piece of Instagram content has gotten. Useless as intelligence for $META's most important customers, their creators. https://t.co/1bux3bZGvb", "url": "https://x.com/Dmichaelsikands/status/2114827886297555134"}, {"article": {"title": "10億トークンをもらってAI秘書体験"}, "author_id": "1357696648751714307", "created_at": "2026-10-26T21:07:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114826179937230863"], "id": "2114826179937230863", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 549, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/CWT8EhBXuN", "url": "https://x.com/Yuki0_0Maru/status/2114826179937230863"}, {"author_id": "1786846062390431744", "created_at": "2026-10-26T20:51:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114822163924664420"], "id": "2114822163924664420", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 424, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Serious question for people who using Meta Muse for work, can you share what you do with it? All my replies saying I’m not fair to Muse but in my tests results are very mid. Way worse than Grok bot or Duet. You tried other agents and chose Muse, why? What’s it good at?", "url": "https://x.com/mrfundman/status/2114822163924664420"}, {"author_id": "2277539719", "created_at": "2026-10-26T20:48: