"type": "quoted"}], "text": "Meta Muse Movie\nStarring: Bunny https://t.co/88qNJyOnaB https://t.co/8dk1N7k8OJ", "url": "https://x.com/maestro_mu/status/2114813058682134582"}, {"author_id": "4803553752", "created_at": "2026-10-26T20:09:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114811757944623241"], "id": "2114811757944623241", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 102, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "META  MUSE  \n(パーソナルAIエージェント)\nインストールしてみたです\n名前はきなこちゃんにした(笑)\n\nこれからインストール予定の方は招待コードを入力してくれると嬉しいです\nお互いに10億MUSEトークンが貰えます\n(パワープランの約2週間分が無料で使える感じです)\n\nコード: PIBJFU", "url": "https://x.com/mori_game_ffbe/status/2114811757944623241"}, {"author_id": "1863031648130072577", "created_at": "2026-10-26T20:02:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114809978221637655"], "id": "2114809978221637655", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "My Meta Muse AI avatar is no longer animating when it's working. Used to have its hands typing on the laptop but now just stare at it. 🤷🏻", "url": "https://x.com/tackticat/status/2114809978221637655"}, {"author_id": "1991204179604566020", "created_at": "2026-10-26T20:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114809295636488308"], "id": "2114809295636488308", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114751739026985329", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @bot Grok Bot leaves Meta Muse in the dark!", "url": "https://x.com/LilyBuzios/status/2114809295636488308"}, {"author_id": "1446179258863210497", "created_at": "2026-10-26T19:42:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114804884075946454"], "id": "2114804884075946454", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1417686048579018753", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impre